<p>Other accounts look busy in the dashboard and still fail commercially. CTR rises while lead quality falls. Smart Bidding trains on the wrong conversion actions. Shopping feeds carry missing attributes, weak titles, or incorrect availability. Meta and Google audiences overlap without frequency control, so the same users see the same offer too often.</p>

<p>We also see budget politics create technical debt. Teams keep legacy campaigns alive because they once worked, then add new experiments on top. The account becomes harder to diagnose each month. A clean rebuild, staged carefully to protect volume, is often cheaper than another year of incremental patches.</p>

